{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_dataset_size", "text": "根据论文，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claims，来自 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_dataset_labels", "text": "这些 claims 根据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "论文指出 FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claims，来自 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "根据证据集，这些 claims 被标注为 “SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES” 或 “NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "pipeline_stages", "text": "该系统是一个包含三个阶段的流水线：（1）问题生成，（2）问题回答，（3）标签分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-010ec9cd6f2b1eb9cb5ec5c1"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "cloze_transform", "text": "论文通过掩蔽 claims 中提供的命名实体，将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze 任务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "qg_accuracy", "text": "问题生成任务在将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze 任务时达到约 90% 的准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "output_labels", "text": "当前分类器能够将 claims 分类为 “SUPPORTS” 和 “MANUAL_REVIEW”；论文指出其无监督模型不支持所有标签。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "label_accuracy", "text": "该方法在转换后数据集的开发集上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率，在测试集上达到 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "supports_accuracy", "text": "论文报告称在 “SUPPORTS” 标签上可达到 80.2% 的标签准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "questions_per_claim", "text": "平均而言，每条 claim 生成 3 个问题；φ = 0.76 要求 4 个问题中至少 3 个被正确回答，φ = 0.67 要求 3 个问题中至少 2 个被正确回答，claim 才会被分类为 “SUPPORTS”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "hexaf_comparison", "text": "论文将其 “SUPPORTS” 标签准确率与监督方法 HexaF 进行比较，并报告在 φ = 0.76 时其方法可与 HexaF 相比。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
